{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;One and Done&quot; is a boss rush game being developed by a 3-person team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can choose one of four weapons to defeat enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and by defeating the boss who rules over each labyrinth, you clear that map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The available weapons are scythe, gauntlet, shotgun, and bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your preferred weapon to analyze the powerful bosses\u2019 mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The brief story goes like this: due to the \u201cOne and Done Project,\u201d the villagers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">were consumed by \u201cJam.\u201d (Here, \u201cJam\u201d refers to a mysterious black substance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This \u201cJam\u201d survives by taking living beings as hosts.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The villagers who were consumed turned into monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and began attacking those around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, some individuals, though consumed by \u201cJam,\u201d managed to keep their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Their physical abilities were enhanced, and they could even wield weapons that normal humans couldn\u2019t handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There were also those who, due to a unique constitution, were not affected by \u201cJam\u201d at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The ones untouched by \u201cJam\u201d stood against the monsters and tried to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the monsters outside were once someone\u2019s family and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because of this, the villagers became increasingly exhausted,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">both mentally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then one day, they learned that the mastermind behind all of this had created a labyrinth,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and inside it, was preparing the next project to wipe out the remaining survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The villagers realized such a tragedy must not be allowed to continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But most of them could not step forward recklessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then, one person declared they would go alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">That person is the protagonist of this game, \u201cPeace.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And so, Peace sets foot into the labyrinth swarming with countless monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/038bc963ae8fac855e131e120c822660.poster.avif?t=1760345514\" width=744 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/038bc963ae8fac855e131e120c822660.webm?t=1760345514\" typ